WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.282
After you upload a file, its page shows what John Deere changed.

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:09.389
The boxes count quantities up and down, new rows, and ship dates moved.

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:15.577
To see only one kind, click Filter, open Change, and pick one, like Qty down.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:25.949
Each row shows the old and the new value, and the order it is on.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.359
To compare any two files, go to Orders, and click Compare versions.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.935
Pick the old version on the left, and the new one on the right.

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:43.607
Click a coloured button, like Qty down, to see only those lines.
